{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/610735fd68332d4305c9ddca7616078f.poster.avif?t=1760029137\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/610735fd68332d4305c9ddca7616078f.webm?t=1760029137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/610735fd68332d4305c9ddca7616078f.mp4?t=1760029137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A brutal dieselpunk experience where you dominate the battlefield through a colossal war machine. Every lever, every dial and every shot is under your control. High Command may send cryptic orders, but you alone pull the trigger. Obey or defy, in this nest you are the god of steel and fire. Beware, each blast tears the silence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.avif?t=1760029137\" data-has-big width=1560 height=150 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/72a013c5f0245ed69ac76790cb007d18.poster.avif?t=1760029137\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/72a013c5f0245ed69ac76790cb007d18.webm?t=1760029137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/72a013c5f0245ed69ac76790cb007d18.mp4?t=1760029137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Orders flow in from everywhere! Battlefield scriptures from High Command, riddles from observers and countless other voices of war. Within their words lie hidden coordinates and veiled intentions. Your duty is to pierce the code, to divine what is truly expected, and to let steel thunder answer their call\u2026   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/b65170f6cd8d226c79e1da47a93783b3.poster.avif?t=1760029137\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/b65170f6cd8d226c79e1da47a93783b3.webm?t=1760029137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/b65170f6cd8d226c79e1da47a93783b3.mp4?t=1760029137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The map is the sacred heart of war, the altar upon which all calculations, estimations, and measures are inscribed. It is the hawk\u2019s eye of the battlefield, the spirit that reveals the enemy\u2019s path. Decisions forged here are like the vows before the deity, and once taken, cannot be undone\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/55c3c7090fae6d7d4186925ad14b18a8.poster.avif?t=1760029137\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/55c3c7090fae6d7d4186925ad14b18a8.webm?t=1760029137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/55c3c7090fae6d7d4186925ad14b18a8.mp4?t=1760029137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Every shell is a sacred instrument of war, each forged with a singular purpose. In choosing the right munition, you bear the weight of judgment in your hands. Each decision echoes across the battlefield, for in your command rests the power to condemn or to deliver\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/2b3ccbc5fb6eeb82d71d6dd50fd2277f.poster.avif?t=1760029137\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/2b3ccbc5fb6eeb82d71d6dd50fd2277f.webm?t=1760029137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/2b3ccbc5fb6eeb82d71d6dd50fd2277f.mp4?t=1760029137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune the settings: adjust angles, refine elevation, and make every lever and dial count. Precision is everything, for even the smallest mistake can turn judgment into chaos and alter the fate of the battlefield\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/15a5bbe3e3f94be8dd61dc1703c39bbc.poster.avif?t=1760029137\" width=1170 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/15a5bbe3e3f94be8dd61dc1703c39bbc.webm?t=1760029137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/15a5bbe3e3f94be8dd61dc1703c39bbc.mp4?t=1760029137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash devastation and watch the battlefield transform under your judgment. Every shot is a divine decree, every impact an echo of your will. When the thunder fades, only silence remains, until the next order descends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.avif?t=1760029137\" data-has-big width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IRON NEST: Heavy Turret Simulator delivers a unique blend of tactical problem-solving, war machine management, and strategic customization. At the heart of the experience lies the battlefield map - the central space where players translate cryptic reports into coordinates, determine where to strike, and set the turret accordingly. Strongly inspired by PVKK, Nick and Dominik openly embrace this influence, considering it a benchmark for a new genre of games to which IRON NEST proudly belongs. It challenges players to read the battlefield, make critical decisions, and adapt through a card-based requisition system that keeps every mission fresh. In this game, precision, strategic thinking, and choices truly matter. The outcome of this war rests entirely in your hands!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2950790?t=1760029137","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/2ee73611b64b00f6d9748aee4d56f3d1d2c0f87f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760029137","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/85966acefb852f59ff4ef535a7beb82f7633e7ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760029137","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/85966acefb852f59ff4ef535a7beb82f7633e7ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760029137","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" 