ared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/extras/4f3f8e9e14e471d9b83111a71da39345.avif?t=1760029137\" data-has-big width=1560 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >IRON NEST: Heavy Turret Simulator delivers a unique blend of tactical problem-solving, war machine management, and strategic customization. At the heart of the experience lies the battlefield map - the central space where players translate cryptic reports into coordinates, determine where to strike, and set the turret accordingly. Strongly inspired by PVKK, Nick and Dominik openly embrace this influence, considering it a benchmark for a new genre of games to which IRON NEST proudly belongs. It challenges players to read the battlefield, make critical decisions, and adapt through a card-based requisition system that keeps every mission fresh. In this game, precision, strategic thinking, and choices truly matter. The outcome of this war rests entirely in your hands!</p>","developers":["Nick Nieuwoudt","Dominik Latos"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/d881dce5e1f421575bf090ff6c02867f403fb0b3/header.jpg?t=1760029137","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"IRON NEST: Heavy Turret Simulator","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Nick Nieuwoudt","Dominik Latos"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","