adb0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1760029137","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2950790/5442db0fa1b430aa048163bd5d4ba9444f8badb0/ss_5442db0fa1b430aa048163bd5d4ba9444f8badb0.600x338.jpg?t=1760029137"}],"short_description":"IRON NEST is a brutal dieselpunk game where the colossal war machine under your control writes history. Strain the hydraulics, grip the levers, and rip firing solutions from battlefield reports to unleash devastating blows, whether you obey or defy High Command. Beware: each blast tears the silence!","steam_appid":2950790,"support_info":{"email":"2stupiddevs@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://linktr.ee/IRONNEST"}